[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "速報速報！\u3000極夜の錬金党は全員倒れたって！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Breaking news! All of the Polar Night Alchemists have been defeated!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フィリス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、やるじゃない！\u3000そしたら、\nざわついてた王都周辺の魔物も落ち着くかしら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well now, not bad at all! Does that mean the monster activity near the capital will finally settle down?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "影響はまだ残っているでしょう。\nしばらくは討伐に出る必要がありそうです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The effects will likely persist for some time. It appears we will need to continue monster suppression efforts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "オディーリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Odelia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "とは言っても、一安心よね。さ、みんな！\nあと一頑張りよ！\u3000最後まで気を抜かないように！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so, we can breathe a little easier! Alright everyone, one more push! Don't let your guard down until the very end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "安心したら、お腹がすいてきたー……。\nお肉！\u3000お肉が食べたい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now that I can relax, I'm getting hungry... Meat! I want meat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フィリス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私も甘いものが必要であると体の機構が\n訴えています",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My internal systems are also signaling a critical need for sweets."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "オディーリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Odelia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おーし、俺の出番だな！\nとっておきの肉料理と甘味を提供してやんよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, sounds like it's my time to shine! I'll whip up some top-notch meat dishes and desserts for ya!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナが出払ってる今こそ、\n俺の甘味だって負けてねえってところを見せる時！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With Rorona out right now, this is my chance to show that my sweets can hold their own too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こらー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここで気を抜いたら後がつらくなるでしょ！\nご褒美はやることやってから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we slack off now, we'll pay for it later! Rewards come after you finish the job!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えーーー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Awww..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フィリス",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Firis"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "不服の意を表明します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wish to lodge a formal complaint."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "オディーリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Odelia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぶーぶー言わない！\nあんたたちのその欲求……いえ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No whining! All of your desires... no, wait—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煩悩は、全部魔物にぶつけてスッキリしなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your worldly attachments need to be unleashed on the monsters instead!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おい！\u3000俺のこの振り上げたフライパンは\nどうすりゃいいんだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! What am I supposed to do with this frying pan I've already got raised up here?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたの料理を作りたい欲求、それも煩悩！！！\nパーンって魔物に振り下ろしておきなさいよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Your burning desire to cook is a worldly attachment too! Go smack it down on some monsters instead!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パーン！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Smack!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イクセル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Iksel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すみません、ミルクを……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, excuse me, could I have some milk..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルネリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それも煩悩！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a worldly attachment too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "コルネリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Corneria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミュー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mu"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煩悩！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Worldly attachment!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぜーんぶ煩悩！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everything's a worldly attachment!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "煩悩はすべて、魔物にぶつけて払いなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take all your worldly attachments and unleash them on the monsters!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "超一流の天才錬金術士を自称する少女。フィリスとは\n親友同士にして、切磋琢磨し合うライバル関係",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A self-proclaimed genius alchemist. She and Firis are best friends and rivals who push each other to greater heights."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イルメリア・フォン・ラインウェバー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ilmeria Von Leinweber"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]